        "text": "projectedOperator (n n' : H) (K : H →L[ℝ] H) (δ : ℝ) = -K + ((innerSL ℝ n).comp K - innerSL ℝ n').smulRight ((⟪n, n⟫_ℝ)⁻¹ • n) - δ • ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ H   (= 𝒜_Φ − δ·Id; docstring: \"Continuous linear part of equation (27), including the moving-normal term\")"
